/Title (At McMaster Exoskeleton, we are advancing human-machine interaction through innovative research and solutions with real-world biomedical applications. By combining mechanical, electrical, and software engineering expertise, we are developing an exoskeleton that pushes the boundaries of assistive robotics. Our work addresses challenges in mobility and rehabilitation while giving students hands-on experience at the intersection of engineering, healthcare, and emerging robotics technology.)
